WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.401 --> 00:00:15.889
Mandy gasped for breath beside a temple column.

2
00:00:15.890 --> 00:00:19.587
"I wish Vinnie were here," she said.

3
00:00:19.588 --> 00:00:23.625
Jason and Vinnie headed toward the Parthenon.

4
00:00:23.626 --> 00:00:26.675
But Socrates stopped them.

5
00:00:26.676 --> 00:00:31.817
"It may not be wise to enter the temple," Socrates warned.

6
00:00:31.818 --> 00:00:37.351
"Great Socrates," said Jason, bowing. "Why?"

7
00:00:37.352 --> 00:00:42.219
"That name sounds familiar," thought Vinnie.

8
00:00:42.220 --> 00:00:48.897
"Inside, a young girl is holding a strange light," Socrates said.

9
00:00:48.898 --> 00:00:50.817
It was Mandy!

10
00:00:50.818 --> 00:00:54.944
"Jason, that's my sister," Vinnie said.

11
00:00:54.945 --> 00:00:57.082
"She won't harm anyone."

12
00:00:57.083 --> 00:01:00.944
"But Socrates said . . . ," cried Jason.

13
00:01:00.945 --> 00:01:03.274
"He doesn't understand.

14
00:01:03.275 --> 00:01:06.471
We both need your help," said Vinnie.

15
00:01:06.472 --> 00:01:09.626
He looked straight into Jason's eyes.

16
00:01:09.627 --> 00:01:13.347
"Then I will help you, Vinnie," Jason said.

17
00:01:13.348 --> 00:01:16.948
Together they ran up the stairs.

18
00:01:16.949 --> 00:01:20.340
"Mandy!" Vinnie called.

19
00:01:20.341 --> 00:01:23.803
"Vinnie! You're here!" she cried.

20
00:01:23.804 --> 00:01:27.815
Vinnie took the photo from Mandy.

21
00:01:27.816 --> 00:01:32.698
"Look! The helmet is glowing brighter!" Vinnie said.

22
00:01:32.699 --> 00:01:36.684
"Where is the statue?" cried Mandy.

23
00:01:36.685 --> 00:01:40.877
"I thought it was in the Parthenon!"

24
00:01:40.878 --> 00:01:43.601
Jason stepped forward.

25
00:01:43.602 --> 00:01:47.342
"It is here. I can take you," he said.

26
00:01:47.343 --> 00:01:50.066
He was glad Mandy was safe.

27
00:01:50.067 --> 00:01:55.533
"On the way, I will tell you the story of Athena."

28
00:01:55.534 --> 00:02:00.777
As Jason talked, the children passed scenes carved on the walls.

29
00:02:00.778 --> 00:02:04.142
Some scenes showed men in chariots.

30
00:02:04.143 --> 00:02:10.209
Another scene showed girls carrying water for the goddess.

31
00:02:10.210 --> 00:02:17.209
"Both Athena and the god of the sea wanted to rule our city," Jason said.

32
00:02:17.210 --> 00:02:21.072
"So they decided to hold a gift-giving contest.

33
00:02:21.073 --> 00:02:26.577
The god of the sea gave the city water.

34
00:02:26.578 --> 00:02:28.485
But it was salty.

35
00:02:28.486 --> 00:02:31.289
Athena's gift was an olive tree.

36
00:02:31.290 --> 00:02:33.886
This tree gave people food.

37
00:02:33.887 --> 00:02:36.943
The people of Athens were very happy.

38
00:02:36.944 --> 00:02:42.075
Athena won and became the goddess of the city."

39
00:02:42.076 --> 00:02:46.473
At last they stopped in front of the statue of Athena.

40
00:02:46.474 --> 00:02:48.267
It was huge!

41
00:02:48.268 --> 00:02:52.143
"Wow!" Mandy cried.

42
00:02:52.144 --> 00:02:54.603
The children were stunned.

43
00:02:54.604 --> 00:02:59.792
The entire sculpture was gold except for the face and arms.

44
00:02:59.793 --> 00:03:04.478
They were white like polished ivory.

45
00:03:04.479 --> 00:03:09.935
"The winged woman in her right hand is Nike," explained Jason.

46
00:03:09.936 --> 00:03:13.633
"She can fly and run faster than anyone.

47
00:03:13.634 --> 00:03:17.601
Nike is the goddess of victory!"

48
00:03:17.602 --> 00:03:21.200
Vinnie took the photo out of his pocket.

49
00:03:21.201 --> 00:03:25.607
In the photo, Athena's helmet was glowing red.

50
00:03:25.608 --> 00:03:28.477
The light hurt the children's eyes.

51
00:03:28.478 --> 00:03:31.607
"We're going home!" Vinnie shouted.

52
00:03:31.608 --> 00:03:35.639
"Good luck at the Olympics, Jason!"

53
00:03:35.640 --> 00:03:41.388
"Vinnie! Mandy! What is happening?" Jason shouted.

54
00:03:41.389 --> 00:03:47.955
His voice faded as the children fell through the dark tunnel.

55
00:03:47.956 --> 00:03:53.288
"Ow!" grunted Mandy, as she hit a solid floor.

56
00:03:53.289 --> 00:03:57.738
"Ugh!" moaned Vinnie.

57
00:03:57.739 --> 00:04:00.563
The children opened their eyes.

58
00:04:00.564 --> 00:04:02.813
They were back in the attic.

59
00:04:02.814 --> 00:04:05.369
They heard footsteps.

60
00:04:05.370 --> 00:04:10.284
They quickly shut the album as the door swung open.

61
00:04:10.285 --> 00:04:13.620
"Didn't you hear me calling?" Dad asked.

62
00:04:13.621 --> 00:04:15.795
"What are you doing up here?"

63
00:04:15.796 --> 00:04:23.990
Vinnie and Mandy looked at each other and smiled.
